# Vercel upload exclusions (§20/§21) — production must never ship:
# the database, backend source, tests, env files, git metadata, docs
# or dependency manifests (the Vercel site is FRONTEND ONLY; /api/*
# is rewritten to the Railway backend in vercel.json).
data/
server/
test/
node_modules/
.git/
.vercel/
.env
.env.example
package.json
package-lock.json
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.log
start.bat
*.md
